flowchart TD
    START([Option 3: Register Vehicle Entry]) --> READ[Read plate number and vehicle type]
    READ --> V1{Plate number empty?}
    V1 -->|Yes| E1[Error: Plate cannot be empty]
    V1 -->|No| V2{Plate exists in activeVehicles map?}

    V2 -->|Yes| E2[Error: Vehicle already parked]
    V2 -->|No| SEARCH[findAvailableSlot vehicleType]

    SEARCH --> LOOP[Iterate all slots in slots map]
    LOOP --> CHECK1{Status = Available?}
    CHECK1 -->|No| NEXT[Next slot]
    CHECK1 -->|Yes| CHECK2{supportedType = vehicleType?}
    CHECK2 -->|No| NEXT
    CHECK2 -->|Yes| FOUND[Return matching Slot ID]
    NEXT --> LOOP
    LOOP -->|No more slots| NONE[Return empty string]

    FOUND --> ALLOC[Lookup slot in slots map]
    NONE --> E3[Error: No suitable slot available]

    ALLOC --> OCCUPY[Set slot status = Occupied]
    OCCUPY --> TIME[Record entryTime = system_clock::now]
    TIME --> CREATE[Create ParkedVehicle object]
    CREATE --> INSERT[Insert into activeVehicles<br/>key = plateNumber]
    INSERT --> SUCCESS[Display confirmation<br/>slot ID and entry time]

    E1 --> END([Return to menu])
    E2 --> END
    E3 --> END
    SUCCESS --> END
